+No $A_f,A_c,P,D$ guard clips occur in any of the 28 runs. No conversion-availability limiter is active in these selected cases. Every run has a single finite-step overshoot of the quality ceiling followed by clipping; at the finest step the largest raw overshoot is $1.25\times10^{-6}$ and the first capped node is $13.8890625$\,yr. The quality-cap non-smoothness is included in the reported residuals rather than hidden by a closure adjustment. At the finest step minimum reserve areas are $0.400000$, $0.775769$, $0.531279$, and $0.286300$\,ha, respectively, above the monitored $0.1$\,ha reserve threshold. Reconstructed total area is conserved to floating-point precision.
