+
+Full-precision component integrals, signed closure residuals, cap/guard diagnostics, and nested-grid comparisons are supplied as CSV/JSON. Finest-step trajectories and cumulative integrals are exported on a $0.05$\,yr reporting grid; the quadrature itself uses every finest-step node, not the coarser export grid. The script regenerates the full integrations locally. The deterministic static witnesses and all new numerical checks are reproducible without network access.
 
